        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.689,
            0.835,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "In each grid, the numbers in each of the two rows (the top row and the bottom row) and the numbers in each of the two columns (the leftmost column and the rightmost column) add up to give the same number. We shall call this sum as the ‘border sum’. The border sum of the first grid is ‘0’."
        },
        {
